      "message": "I think we want to apply \"-Wall\", \"-Wextra\", \"-Werror\" to tools as well.\n\nAlso this default is included in tools already as all cc_targets have this default, I\u0027m mostly only documenting it \n\nFor example: https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/tools/rootcanal/Android.bp;l\u003d36;drc\u003da9635a2a9158b272631c3216fee13abca32d1bdc",
