        "id": 1964701
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-28T22:21:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Try to keep the name as precise as possible... f you add a new option that isn\u0027t\n\u003e     documented by the name of this default, rename it.\n\nI can understand that you want to avoid misuse. but simply renaming this default is a non-trivial change. \nAs we discussed, how about relaxing the name a little to make some space for options other than cflags? I think the documentation in the comment is instructive enough, and anyone trying to make change to this would be very careful.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 71,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 71,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "e68d70f6d6e72a778a1c8febe3e5e64db899c451",
